    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2024-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2024-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="0"></target>
     <actual value="7700.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">07-04-2025: A total of 2,000 wells were tested, of which water samples from 700 wells were analysed using ICP-MS. The analysis revealed that 77% of these wells contained water with contaminant levels exceeding established safety thresholds. Based on these findings, we notified the users and owners of the affected wells and directed them to alternative nearby wells with safe water. It is estimated that approximately 7,700 individuals rely on these wells, based on an average of 11 people per well. These wells are situated within communal areas.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
